@startuml sequence_diagram_spa_startup
autonumber
title WEB01 - UC1: load the SPA and open a route

actor "Website user" as User
participant Browser
participant "Static host" as Host
participant App
participant appConfig as Config
participant "BrowserRouter / Routes" as Router
participant AppShell as Shell
participant AuthProvider as Auth
participant healthApi as Health
participant authApi as AuthApi
participant apiClient as Client
participant "Back-End API" as API

User -> Browser : Open or reload a page URL
Browser -> Host : GET /register (example of a direct link)
Host --> Browser : index.html (fallback for SPA paths)
Browser -> Host : GET linked JS/CSS assets
Host --> Browser : Compiled assets
Browser -> App : main.jsx mounts App
App -> Config : getAppConfig()
alt Invalid public configuration
  Config --> App : Configuration error
  App --> User : Show configuration error; no API request
else Valid public configuration
  Config --> App : apiBaseUrl, apiTimeoutMs
  App -> Auth : Mount once in the application tree
  App -> Router : Mount BrowserRouter and Routes
  Router -> Shell : Render common layout and matching route
  alt Known route
    Shell --> User : Show route; protected content waits for confirmed roles
  else Unknown route
    Shell --> User : Show page not found inside the same layout
  end

  par Check API availability
    Shell -> Health : getHealth(signal)
    Health -> Client : get("/health", { signal })
    Client -> API : GET /api/v1/health
    opt API responds
      API --> Client : Health response or HTTP failure
    end
    alt Valid JSON with status "ok"
      Client --> Health : HealthDTO
      Health --> Shell : Backend: OK
    else Other status, network error or timeout
      Client --> Health : HealthDTO with other status or ApiError
      Health --> Shell : Show unavailable status and offer retry
    end
  else Restore the shared session (AA04)
    Auth -> AuthApi : resumeSession()
    AuthApi -> Client : post("/auth/resume", credentials: include)
    Client -> API : POST /api/v1/auth/resume with browser cookie
    alt Session restored
      API --> Client : AuthTokenDTO
      Client --> AuthApi : Parsed DTO
      AuthApi --> Auth : JWT and CSRF in memory
      ref over Auth, API : Resolve current roles with GET /auth/me (AA03)
    else No valid session or restore failed
      opt API responds
        API --> Client : HTTP error (401 when no valid session)
      end
      Client --> AuthApi : ApiError
      AuthApi --> Auth : Remain guest or denied; keep protected content hidden
    end
  else If the matched route is the Google callback
    ref over Router, API : AA02 callback: consume code/state once and remove query;\naccept the session and replace URL on success, or show feedback in the shell
  end

  opt User follows an internal link or uses browser back/forward
    User -> Router : Navigate within the SPA
    Router -> Shell : Match URL and replace route content
    note right of Router : No full page reload
  end
end
@enduml
